---
system: sys-16-parent-mobile-application
flow_id: ble-provisioning
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/16-parent-mobile-application#5-3-device-and-provisioning-system-02
actors: [ParentApp, BLEDevice, Gateway, DeviceService, Device]
apis:
  - POST /v1/devices/provision/start
  - GET /v1/devices/:id
  - POST /v1/devices/provision/complete
externals: [BLE]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - ble_permission_denied
  - ble_device_not_found
  - already_assigned
  - provision_not_ready
  - wifi_handshake_failed
  - device_status_poll_timeout
idempotency: provisioningToken issued by /provision/start scopes the BLE session — /provision/complete uses {deviceId, childProfileId} which is naturally idempotent
retry: caller-side BLE scan retries on permission/timeout — never auto-retry /provision/complete on 4xx
timeout: BLE handshake 30s — HTTP calls 10s — Wi-Fi handshake poll up to 60s (5s interval)
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Normalized from spec sequenceDiagram at 16-parent-mobile-application.md#L397 — Device (Wi-Fi) shown as the cloud-bound peer that mTLS-handshakes after BLE credential write.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant BLEDevice
    participant Gateway
    participant DeviceService
    participant Device

    ParentApp->>ParentApp: request BLE + location permissions
    alt ble_permission_denied
        ParentApp-->>ParentApp: navigate to settings prompt — abort
    else permission granted
        ParentApp->>BLEDevice: scan for "TBot-XXXX" advert
        alt ble_device_not_found
            BLEDevice-->>ParentApp: scan timeout (30s) — retry prompt
        else device discovered
            BLEDevice-->>ParentApp: serial advert (e.g. TBT-2026-004217)
            ParentApp->>BLEDevice: connect + discover services + read serial char
            BLEDevice-->>ParentApp: serial confirmation
            ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/devices/provision/start {serialNumber}
            Gateway->>DeviceService: forward
            alt already_assigned
                DeviceService-->>Gateway: 409 already_assigned
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409
            else ready
                DeviceService-->>Gateway: 200 {provisioningToken, deviceId}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
                ParentApp->>BLEDevice: write Wi-Fi credentials to provisioning characteristic
                BLEDevice-->>ParentApp: ACK
                Note over BLEDevice,Device: device connects to Wi-Fi, performs mTLS handshake with cloud (sys-02)
                loop poll every 5s up to 60s
                    ParentApp->>Gateway: GET /v1/devices/:id
                    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward
                    DeviceService-->>Gateway: {status: provisioning | online | offline}
                    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
                end
                alt wifi_handshake_failed
                    Note over ParentApp: status stays "offline" past poll deadline
                    ParentApp-->>ParentApp: surface retry-Wi-Fi-credentials prompt
                else device online
                    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/devices/provision/complete {deviceId, childProfileId}
                    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward
                    alt provision_not_ready
                        DeviceService-->>Gateway: 409 not_ready
                        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409
                    else completed
                        DeviceService-->>Gateway: 200 OK
                        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over ParentApp,Device: timeout — BLE handshake 30s, HTTP 10s, status poll up to 60s — never auto-retry /provision/complete on 4xx
